IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-LORA-FEDERATED.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-CLIENTS         PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 ADAPTER-RANK        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 BASE-DIM            PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 FIDELITY-PCT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-FEDERATED.
    IF NUM-CLIENTS == 0 OR ADAPTER-RANK == 0 OR BASE-DIM == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 99 TO FIDELITY-PCT.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-CLIENTS.
    WEIGHT 30 FIDELITY-PCT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
